      displayTexts:
      - You see the pain in the eyes of the family on the right side of the room.
        Already concerned by their last statements, you share the pain and sadness
        they feel. You respond back, "What are they going to do?"
      - 'The father whispered back, "They will execute me soon and keep my wife as
        a breeder and raise our son into this... this cult. Because we do not abide
        by the Religion of S. They told us that it is too late for us to convert.
        Please, we don''t want any trouble. We will do anything." '
