      displayTexts:
      - 'You heard the despair in the family''s voice during the last conversation.
        You turn your attention back to them on the right side of the room. With
        a newfound joy that came about, you try to create an optimistic shift in
        tone. '
      - '"Don''t fret. You will be all right!" They don''t share your positive views.
        They whisper back, "No, they will kill us." You give a wink back. "Don''t
        worry, I will handle it." Despite not sharing your enthusiasm, they do look
        a little more relaxed.'
