  UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts:
  - name_: Observation
    UseEmotionKey: 0
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - 'The family looks off. They are much more disheveled than the others in the
      room and only ones without robes, with their matted hair and the stench. Even
      more peculiar is that they all shared the same faces. The father, toddler son,
      and mother all had the same face. The toddler himself has the facial feature
      of an adult. The mom without the longer hair looks identical to the father
      up to the broad shoulders and freckle on the side of the mouth. '
  - name_: Fear Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'You see the fear in the family on the right side of the room. Your own voice
      trembles and quakes as you ask them what happened. You can''t stop your body
      from shaking in the uncertainty and danger of this labyrinth. Your uneasiness
      freezes them even further, shutting them down from responding and even causing
      the father to break down into tears. '
  - name_: Joy Hand
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 0
    displayTexts:
    - 'You look to the family on the right and reach out your hand for a friendly
      handshake. They do not reciprocate. Their eyes are wide in terror. '
